WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.760
Ownership must cover the whole lifecycle.

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:05.200
Product and quality owners
define behavior and outcomes.

00:00:05.289 --> 00:00:10.000
Platform teams support context,
execution and evidence services.

00:00:10.089 --> 00:00:12.960
Delivery teams own tests and review.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:16.480
Independent challenge examines
exceptions and open risks,

00:00:16.507 --> 00:00:21.200
while operations and value owners follow
incidents and actual capacity use.

00:00:21.347 --> 00:00:25.360
These responsibilities should fit
existing institutional accountability.

00:00:25.451 --> 00:00:29.280
Shared infrastructure should make
ownership clearer, rather than move

00:00:29.324 --> 00:00:34.400
business decisions into
an undefined central team.
